{
  "_comment": "Externalised Sainsbury's selectors (spec 11, Phase 6 recon). Bind to data-testid ONLY — CSS classes are hashed and data-pkgid churns. The site spans two stacks mid-migration: NEW /groceries/ (React 'fable', gw-* testids) and OLD /gol-ui/ (Angular 'Luna', pt-*/trolley-item-*/order-summary-*). Values are raw data-testid names unless prefixed with 'css:' (then treated as a raw CSS selector).",
